    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f034916c4561bc21ed80fc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 12 Mar 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「内容简介」</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这期节目中，我们有幸与脱不花——得到APP的联合创始人和CEO，同时也是《沟通的方法》和《干得漂亮》等畅销书的作者，进行了一场关于职场、创业和个人成长的对话。17岁辍学的花姐，为何能在19岁成为CEO？得到是如何诞生的？谈及女性在职场中遭遇的挑战，花姐又为何认为可能再过十年绝大部分的高层管理者岗位会是女性？</span></p><span></span><p><span>「本期嘉宾」</span></p><span></span><p><span>得到联合创始人 脱不花</span></p><span></span><p><span>「节目导航」</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">7:00</a>】得到成立源于罗振宇的一个问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="661">11:01</a>】脱不花的朋友圈包含了哪三类人？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a>】人生中的第一个重要节点</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1158">19:18</a>】从行政到总经理</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1675">27:55</a>】职业中的第一位贵人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a>】在产房中工作其实并不悲情</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3285">54:45</a>】在职场中巧干并不苦</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3742">62:22</a>】家长会假</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4192">69:52</a>】可能再过十年，绝大部分的高层管理者岗位都会是女性</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4316">71:56</a>】女性在工作中有哪些优势</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5058">84:18</a>】在职场中要带着方法去工作</span></p><span></span><p><span>能让你工作不受气，更快出成绩的花姐新书《干得漂亮》正式开售！现在扫码或点击下方链接购买还能立减20～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvAK2YE4fa2aBkNeDhbxgf4Bk8JD.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://item.m.jd.com/product/14378766.html?gx=RnAoFcrBvplZz5AX49UzFw&amp;gxd=RnAowmBdPmbews4T-oUkXqKSb9Hi170&amp;ad_od=share&amp;utm_source=androidapp&amp;utm_medium=appshare&amp;utm_campaign=t_335139774&amp;utm_term=QRCode" href="https://item.m.jd.com/product/14378766.html?gx=RnAoFcrBvplZz5AX49UzFw&amp;gxd=RnAowmBdPmbews4T-oUkXqKSb9Hi17