  <item>
    <title>Vol.020 一张卡牌价值三千万？！揭秘让美国顶流网红与迪拜土豪疯狂的宝可梦卡牌</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65797da620d779b49d666425</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65797da620d779b49d666425</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Dec 2023 09:47:18 +0000</pubDate>
